\"The new policy applies to all client correspondence, regardless of value.\"\n\nBased only on the passage, is the statement true, false, or can you not say?"},{"pack_slug":"passage-analysis","display_order":2,"subtype":"True / False / Cannot say","difficulty":"medium","stimulus":"A recent change to workplace policy at a mid-sized law firm requires all client correspondence above a specified value threshold to be reviewed by a second qualified solicitor before being sent. The firm's managing partner stated the change was introduced after a small number of drafting errors were identified in high-value client communications over the previous year.","prompt":"Statement: \"Drafting errors had never occurred at the firm before the previous year.\"\n\nBased only on the passage, is the statement true, false, or can you not say?"},{"pack_slug":"passage-analysis","display_order":3,"subtype":"True / False / Cannot say","difficulty":"easy","stimulus":"A recent change to workplace policy at a mid-sized law firm requires all client correspondence above a specified value threshold to be reviewed by a second qualified solicitor before being sent. The firm's managing partner stated the change was introduced after a small number of drafting errors were identified in high-value client communications over the previous year.","prompt":"Statement: \"The policy change was a direct response to identified drafting errors.\"\n\nBased only on the passage, is the statement true, false, or can you not say?"},{"pack_slug":"graduate-programme-scenarios","display_order":1,"subtype":"Integrity","difficulty":"medium","stimulus":null,"prompt":null},{"pack_slug":"graduate-programme-scenarios","display_order":2,"subtype":"Teamwork","difficulty":"medium","stimulus":null,"prompt":null},{"pack_slug":"graduate-programme-scenarios","display_order":3,"subtype":"Communication","difficulty":"medium","stimulus":null,"prompt":null},{"pack_slug":"data-interpretation","display_order":1,"subtype":"Percentage change","difficulty":"medium","stimulus":null,"prompt":null},{"pack_slug":"data-interpretation","display_order":2,"subtype":"Profit and margin","difficulty":"medium","stimulus":null,"prompt":null},{"pack_slug":"data-interpretation","display_order":3,"subtype":"Percentages","difficulty":"easy","stimulus":null,"prompt":null},{"pack_slug":"sequences-and-patterns","display_order":1,"subtype":"Sequences","difficulty":"easy","stimulus":null,"prompt":null},{"pack_slug":"sequences-and-patterns","display_order":2,"subtype":"Number sequences","difficulty":"easy","stimulus":null,"prompt":null},{"pack_slug":"sequences-and-patterns","display_order":3,"subtype":"Counting","difficulty":"easy","stimulus":null,"prompt":null}]$legacy$::jsonb)
